      <!-- Search -->
      <meta name="description" its:translate="yes">Read the CPU temperature from the ACPI thermal zones without extra software or with the sensors command, and monitor it in real time</meta>

      <abstract>
        <para>
          &productname; reports the temperature of the CPU and other components
          through ACPI thermal zones and hardware monitoring devices. Read the
          CPU temperature from the ACPI thermal zones without installing any
          software, or list all sensors with the <command>sensors</command>
          command. Monitoring the temperature helps you reduce energy costs and
          detect cooling problems early.
        </para>
        <para><emphasis>Prerequisites:</emphasis></para>
        <itemizedlist>
          <listitem>
            <para>
              <literal>sudo</literal> privileges to install the
              <package>sensors</package> package and to run
              <command>sensors-detect</command> (reading the temperature
              requires no special privileges)
            </para>
          </listitem>
        </itemizedlist>
      </abstract>
